  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This is related to the sharing system that was recently added to the open beta. Although it is nice to share my emojis and stickers with other VRC+ members, I feel like this feature would work nicely if non-VRC+ members were able to receive shared items too. This would allow those players to collect those items, but not be able to use them until they purchase VRC+. This way, they could make a collection of VRC+ content, which could encourage them to purchase VRC+ in the future to be able to use their collection of emojis and stickers.",
